    "description": "High Protein Crispy Honey Garlic Chicken Fried Rice 🍗🍯🍘\n51g Protein Meal Prep💪🏼\n\n(Macros Per Serve, Makes 7)\n546 Calories\n66.5gC | 7gF | 51gP\n\nWant more meals like this? Comment “eBook” & I’ll DM you the details to my digital cookbooks with 280+ high protein recipes 👨🏻‍🍳📚\n\nIngredients:\n• 1.05kg Diced Boneless & Skinless Chicken Breast (raw weight)\n• 35ml Salt Reduced Soy Sauce (Kikkoman)\n• 2 Garlic Cloves, minced\n• 1/2 Tsp Black Pepper\n• 1 Tsp Onion Powder\n• 1 Tsp Garlic Powder\n• 100g Potato Starch (not all used, roughly 40g sticks to the chicken)\n• 500g Frozen Mixed Vegetables\n• 4 Eggs + 200g Egg Whites (or 5 whole eggs)\n• 30g Spring Onion, white part only\n• 980g Day Old Cooked White Rice\n• 40ml Salt Reduced Soy Sauce\n• 20g Spring Onion, green part only\n\nHoney Garlic Sauce:\n• 5 Garlic Cloves, minced\n• 60ml Salt Reduced Soy Sauce + 60ml Water\n• 100g Reduced Sugar Ketchup\n• 25ml Rice Wine Vinegar\n• 1 Tsp Cornflour + 80ml Water\n• 80g Honey\n\n#friedrice #friedchicken #chickenrecipes #mealprep #highprotein",
